# Deduplicated GRCh38 silencer ELS source pools by chromosome

This directory contains chromosome-specific silencer-positive BED files generated
by `src/get_whole_body_regulatory_sets.sh`. pELS and dELS records from seven
silencer studies are consolidated, repeated cCRE IDs are verified to be identical,
and one record per cCRE ID is retained before chromosome splitting.

| chromosome | silencer_source_rows | duplicate_rows_removed | unique_positive_loci |
|:-----------|----------------------:|-----------------------:|---------------------:|
| chr1  | 29,777 | 857 | 28,920 |
| chr2  | 14,579 | 288 | 14,291 |
| chr3  | 9,728 | 145 | 9,583 |
| chr4  | 11,068 | 233 | 10,835 |
| chr5  | 10,817 | 319 | 10,498 |
| chr6  | 16,650 | 429 | 16,221 |
| chr7  | 8,708 | 443 | 8,265 |
| chr8  | 7,647 | 323 | 7,324 |
| chr9  | 10,912 | 446 | 10,466 |
| chr10 | 8,030 | 213 | 7,817 |
| chr11 | 12,565 | 512 | 12,053 |
| chr12 | 7,783 | 228 | 7,555 |
| chr13 | 1,439 | 12 | 1,427 |
| chr14 | 4,124 | 132 | 3,992 |
| chr15 | 8,894 | 255 | 8,639 |
